					"nextDialogs": [
						400030902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030902,
					"content": "……$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030903,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，怎么办，这个人看起来很难沟通的样子。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030904,
					"content": "呜啊。感、感觉，并不是善人…$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030905,
					"content": "不要只依靠感觉，就对「善恶」随口评说。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030906,
					"content": "不过，我确实是恶鬼。我是斩杀妖物、魔障的护法夜叉，魈。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030908,
					"content": "这个名词前两天好像听过。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030910
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400030909,
					"content": "派蒙知道「夜叉」吗？$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030910
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400030907,
					"content": "护法夜叉…！$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030908,
						400030909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030910,
					"content": "对、对了…之前有听璃月的人说过…夜叉也是守护璃月的仙人…$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030911,
					"content": "暗中镇守人类的世界，为不知情的凡人斩妖除魔…$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030912,
					"content": "一般意义上，这不就是叫做善人吗！$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030913,
					"content": "…不。夜叉的「护法」，并不出于对人类的善意。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030914
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030914,
					"content": "呜…明明海灯节的主题，就是纪念英雄。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030915
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030915,
					"content": "历史上护佑璃月的那些英雄，难得有一个活到现在的，却对纪念自己的节日不领情呢。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030916
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030916,
					"content": "……$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030917
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030917,
					"content": "魈先生…呃，魈上仙…？为什么你刚才不直接制伏那个可疑的家伙呢？$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030918
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030918,
					"content": "本以为是妖物作祟，我才过来看看。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030919
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030919,
					"content": "如果在仙与魔的世界，有什么东西失去桎梏，那就是我的责任。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030920
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030920,
					"content": "但这次的威胁来自人类的世界——你们的世界，所以这是你的责任，人类旅者。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030921
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030921,
					"content": "必要时…也希望你自觉一些，下手果断。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030922
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030922,
					"content": "不要让斩妖之枪的枪缨，沾染凡间之血。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030923
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030923,
					"content": "这个是——$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400030924
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400030925,
					"content": "派蒙认识吗？$UNRELEASED",
